{"answer": "1. $G(z)=\\dfrac{K\\left[(e^{-0.1}-0.9)z+(1-1.1e^{-0.1})\\right]}{(z-1)(z-e^{-0.1})}$，$\\Phi(z)=\\dfrac{G(z)}{1+G(z)}$，特征方程 $D(z)=z^2+(0.005K-1.905)z+0.0045K+0.905=0$。\n\n2. 朱利判据：$D(1)=0.0095K>0$，$D(-1)=3.81-0.0005K>0$，$|0.0045K+0.905|<1$，综合得 $0<K<21.11$ 时稳定。\n\n3. I 型系统，单位阶跃稳态误差 $e_{ss}=0$（在稳定范围内）。", "explanation": "$G(z)=K\\dfrac{z-1}{z}\\mathcal Z\\!\\left[\\dfrac1{s^2}-\\dfrac1s+\\dfrac1{s+1}\\right]$，留数法得部分分式系数 $A=1,\\ B=-1,\\ C=1$。", "originalImages": [{"src": "img/a2025-5-1.png", "w": 610}, {"src": "img/a2025-5-2.png", "w": 542}], "answerPdfPages": "192–202"}